<title>USA: Harrisburg, Pa., $4.8 mln deal at 5.1 pct in 2005.</title>
<headline>Harrisburg, Pa., $4.8 mln deal at 5.1 pct in 2005.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Securities Inc said Thursday it priced $4.8 million Harrisburg Authority, Pa., bonds at a top yield of 5.10 percent in 2005.</p>
<p>The pricing follows:</p>
<p>THE HARRISBURG AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $4,795,000*</p>
<p>DAUPHIN COUNTY, PENNSYLVANIA</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS (POOLED BOND PROGRAM)</p>
<p>SERIES II OF 1996</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 10/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 03/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 09/01</p>
<p>MATURITY		 AMOUNT*    COUPON	 PRICE</p>
<p>09/01/1997		  435M    4.00  %	100.00</p>
<p>09/01/1998		  460M    4.25  %	100.00</p>
<p>09/01/1999		  480M    4.35  %	  4.45</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.726)</p>
<p>09/01/2000		  505M    4.40  %	  4.50</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.641)</p>
<p>09/01/2001		  530M    4.55  %	  4.65</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.561)</p>
<p>09/01/2002		  550M    4.70  %	  4.80</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.486)</p>
<p>09/01/2003		  585M    4.80  %	  4.90</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.415)</p>
<p>09/01/2004		  610M    4.90  %	  5.00</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.348)</p>
<p>09/01/2005		  640M    5.00  %	  5.10</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.286)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, September 5, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on October 3, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>PNC Securities Corp</p>
<p>Hopper Soliday &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
